{"message":"I can help with all three requests: closing your Light Blue checking account, opening a higher-benefit checking account, and opening a personal savings account. To access your account and verify eligibility, please provide any two of these four details: date of birth, email address, phone number, or current address.

Based on the available products, Bluest Account offers the broadest listed checking benefits, including 2.25% APY, a dedicated personal banker, wire benefits, ATM-fee rebates, and foreign-ATM fee waivers. For savings, the best choice depends on your eligible checking-account pairing and any credit cards you hold; the highest applicable checking and credit-card bonuses can apply, but bonuses of the same type do not stack.

Once verified, I’ll check your account status, balance, pending transactions, account tenure, existing account counts, and eligibility before taking any closure or opening action. Please also confirm whether you want the new savings account funded immediately with the $25,000."}

